kpi Budget spent | $27.8M of $41.5M | 67.0% | neutral

## Project at a glance
To finish all panels by 2026-12-04, 7 weeks away, the crew has to average 5,074 panels a week. At the current pace, panels would finish about 2027-01-02.

## Installation pace
data pace = week,panels; Week 1,3300; Week 2,3050; Week 3,3200; Week 4,3150
chart bar pace y=panels labels title="Panels installed per week, last four weeks" target="5074 needed"

The average over the last four weeks is 3,175 panels a week.

## Milestones
table = Milestone,Date,Status; Site grading,2026-05-22,Done; Foundations and trackers,2026-09-04,Done; Panels installed,2026-12-04 planned (forecast 2027-01-02),At risk; Substation witness test,2026-11-19,Planned; Energization,2027-01-15,At risk; Commercial operation,2027-02-01,Planned

## Needs attention
A second crew starting 2026-10-26 would add about 2,200 panels a week, taking the rate to about 5,375 a week. That is enough only if no more than 2 weather days are lost.

!! The owner must approve $380,000 for the second crew by 2026-10-21.
